  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……契約書、確かに受け取った\r\n１部は円香が大切に保管しておいてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "２８３プロダクションへようこそ\r\nこれからよろしくな、円香",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040010,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040020,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "浅倉はもう\r\n活動を始めているんですよね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……突発で入ってもらった案件があるけど\r\nまだ宣材写真を撮らせてもらったばかりだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、ほぼ同じ立ち位置から\r\n同じ足並みでやっていけるだろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040030,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "そうですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040030"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00413",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それじゃあ\r\n早速レッスンのカリキュラムを組んでいいかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "円香もまずは宣材写真を撮ることになるから\r\nポージングのレッスンから入ってもらうことになる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040040,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "はい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけどその後は円香の目標に合わせて\r\nレッスンを組んでいこうと思うから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040050,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "お任せします",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………その\r\n教えてくれるなら、でいいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "円香がアイドルに\r\nなる理由が知りたい",
    "nextLabel": "1",
    "bgm": "127"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "autoWaitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "透と一緒にアイドルをやりたかった────\r\n……それだけか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040070,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……今さら理由が必要ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これから俺と一緒に頑張ってもらうからには\r\n知っておきたいと思った",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "スカウトした時にも話したように",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は円香のことも\r\n円香の望む空へ羽ばたかせてあげたいと思っているから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040080,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040090,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……あなたは\r\n勘違いをしているようですが",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040100,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "夢とか目標とか、ありません\r\nそんなもの",
    "charAnim1": "sigh",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040110,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "仕事であるからにはきちんとやります\r\nほどほどに",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040120,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "ですからどうぞ\r\nあなたのその熱意は、他のアイドルに注いでください",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040130,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "勝手に期待するだけして\r\n後からがっかりされても困るので",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……円香",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040140,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……契約を取りやめたいというなら\r\nそれでも構いません",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そのつもりはない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0328",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夢や目標がなくたって\r\n全然構わないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "円香がいつか、飛びたいと思った時のために\r\n翼をあげたいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040150,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルのこともこれから知っていけばいい\r\n違うと思えばやめたっていい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まずはやってみないか？\r\n俺と一緒に",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040160,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……なるほど？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040170,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "あなたが浅倉をスカウトする場面が\r\n目に浮かぶようでした",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040180,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "まあ\r\n今さら断るつもりもありません",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040190,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "あなたの言葉が欺瞞かどうか\r\nやってみればわかることですから",
    "charAnim1": "sigh",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……少しずつでいい\r\n信頼してもらえるように、頑張るよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "改めてだけど、これからよろしくな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040200,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040200",
    "autoWaitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1021005040210,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "では、レッスンのカリキュラムについては\r\nお任せします",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100504/1021005040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、わかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
